  "system": {
    "biography": "<p>Shaka Jubowel, named for the great African conqueror Shaka Zulu, learned the magic of the Sixth World from shamans still carrying on ancient traditions before leaving to make a name for himself. As <strong>Pride</strong> he became a globally active shadowrunner specialising in <strong>bounty-hunting</strong>.</p><p>Almost two metres, muscular, very black skin, long stringy hair down the back of his neck, and eyes with <strong>vertical pupils like a cat's</strong>. He usually wears real leather clothing of African design. He behaves like an aristocrat, is always cunning, and becomes savage when angered. <em>\"Pride gives no quarter in combat.\"</em></p><p><strong>Lion totem.</strong> Astral Pool 14. Sorcery specialises in <em>Ritual</em> sorcery — he is a ritual tracker, which is how a bounty hunter finds people.</p><p><em>Queen Euphoria p.26. This character had no actor at all. Block completed from the render 2026-08-03 — an earlier crop had lost Body, Armed Combat and three spells.</em></p>",
